  "prefLabel": "Fors 103.04 The Chairperson and Vice Chairperson",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fors 103.04 The Chairperson and Vice Chairperson. The chairperson shall preside at all meetings. In the absence of the chairperson, the vice-chairperson shall preside.\n\nSource. #6915, eff 12-22-98",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fors100-500.html"
